                                                "sense_id": "ef41008c-41b2-323c-a9c6-989253c7ae8a",
                                                "text": "I was much struck with the gaiety of the creoles , whose exterior told a stranger that education had been doing something among them in these solitudes ; and as all the parties kissed the Bible in conformation with the law of England"
